cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "SodaMem: Evidence-grounded temporal memory for AI agents"
message: "If you use SodaMem in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: WAN
    given-names: FENGRONG
repository-code: "https://github.com/SodaMem/SodaMem"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.0
abstract: >-
  SodaMem is a memory layer for AI agents in which every stored fact keeps a
  foreign-key chain back to the conversation turn that produced it, and carries
  four independent time axes (occurred, valid, said, stored) so that a fact can
  stop being true without being deleted. Retrieval is deterministic and makes no
  model call on the default path.
keywords:
  - agent-memory
  - temporal-knowledge-graph
  - retrieval
  - provenance
  - llm
